Dear Craig,

Greetings from Bushveld Timber with our newsletter edition October 2026.

Thank you for your continued support from all of us, and to the team at Bay Dental Rooms.

Product news this month includes fresh stock of laminated pine beams for pergolas and verandas, plus a new range of outdoor decking boards treated for summer rain. We also have handy offcuts ideal for craft and school projects available at the yard.

Seasonal tip as we head into summer is to seal outdoor timber early before the heavy rains arrive. A light sand and two coats of exterior sealer will keep decks and benches in good shape through the season and reduce maintenance later.

We enjoy sharing ideas for building and maintaining with timber around the home and the workplace.

To unsubscribe from this monthly newsletter, please reply to this email with unsubscribe in the subject line and we will remove you from the list.

